== Description ==
The [[:Category:Tier_3_Pets|Tier 3]] version of {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Soulstealer}}. Available only to the {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Archon}} class and can be only be evolved from a Soulstealer once it reaches a certain level (325). Bestows a lot of different bonuses, unlocking more as it reaches higher level.

Experience gained per second depends on character experience.

== Pet Ability ==

On ability activation (every 1 second), grants 1 [[Sources|mana source]] whose cost must not exceed:
<br><math>10\,000 \times M</math>

From level 25, multiplies Shards Pool capacity by:
<br><math>P^{0.02} \times L^{2} \times 1000000</math>


From level 50, multiplies spell shards per click by:
<br><math>P^{0.15} \times L^{2} \times 0.0025 + 1</math>


From level 75, autoclicks:
<br><math>1 + \frac{L-75}{16} \times P^{0.015}</math>
<br>times each second, with:
<br><math>\text{Click Profit}\ =\ \text{Hero Click Profit}</math>
<br><math>\text{Crit Chance}\ =\ \text{Hero Crit Chance}</math>
<br><math>\text{Crit Profit}\ =\ \text{Hero Crit Profit}</math>

From level 100, multiplies spell shards per second by:
<br><math>P^{0.15} \times L^{2}\times 0.002 + 1</math>


From level 125, multiplies profits by:
<br><math>P^{0.16} \times L \times C \times 0.002 + 1</math>


From level 150, multiplies Evocation efficiency by:
<br><math>P^{0.17} \times L^{2} \times S^{0.15} \times 0.00005 + 1</math>


From level 175, multiplies Incantation efficiency by:
<br><math>P^{0.065} \times L^{1.15} \times 0.01 + 1</math>


From level 200, multiplies Mysteries power by:
<br><math>P^{0.12} \times L^{2} \times (D + 1) \times 0.006 + 1</math>


From level 225, multiplies Void Profit by:
<br><math>P^{0.12} \times L^{2} \times 0.00008 + 1</math>


From level 250, multiplies Void Entity lifetime by:
<br><math>P^{0.23} \times L^{2} \times 0.0001 + 1</math>
<br>And Void Entity spawn rate by:
<br><math>P^{0.06} \times L^{2} \times 0.00001 + 1</math>


From level 275, multiplies Character Ability Power by:
<br><math>P^{0.13} \times (L - 274)^{2} \times 0.0002 + 1</math>


From level 300, multiplies Void Mana per Entity by:
<br><math>P^{0.125} \times \max(1, L - 300)^{2} \times 0.0014 + 1</math>


From level 325, multiplies Pet Ability Power by:
<br><math>\left(\log_{10}(Y) - 474\right) \times (L - 324)^{2} \times 0.003 + 1</math>
<br>''Note: Grants no bonus below 1e475 Mysteries.''


From level 400, multiplies Void Mana per Entity by:
<br><math>P^{0.1} \times \max(1, L - 400)^{2} \times \log_{10}(E) \times \frac{6.25}{10^6} + 1</math>


From level 500, charges non-shard spells over time by (min 1%, max 3%):<br>
<math>\frac{\log_{10}(P)}{10^6} \times \max(1, L - 500)</math>

From level 600, multiplies Summoning Efficiency by:
<br><math>P^{0.1} \times \max(1, L - 600)^{2} \times 1.25 + 1</math>


From level 700, increases amount of Arcanasprings by:
<br><math>\max(1, L - 700)</math>

where:
* <math>M = \text{All Mana this Realm}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>C = \text{Character Level}</math>
* <math>S = \text{Spells Cast this Exile}</math>
* <math>D = \text{Enchanting Dust Collected this Exile}</math>
* <math>Y = \text{Current Amount of Mysteries}</math>
* <math>E = \text{Evocation Efficiency}</math>

== Experience Gain ==

Accrues experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>\left( 0.3 \times X^K + F \right) \times M</math>

The XP needed for the next level is multiplied by 1.16 per level:
<br><math>N_{L} = 100 \times 1.16^{L-1}</math>
<br>''Note: This is the same as a Tier 1 pet.''


where:
* <math>X = \text{Total Character Experience}</math>
* <math>K =\begin{cases}
0.05 + 0.1\times\left(\frac{\widetilde{C}}{100}\right)^3, &\text{if } \widetilde{C} < 300, \text{ and} \\
0.05 + 0.1\times 27 \times \left(\frac{\widetilde{C}}{100} - 2\right), &\text{else}.
\end{cases}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>
* <math>\widetilde{C} = \max\{101,\ \text{Character Level}\}</math>
* <math>N_{L} = \text{XP from Pet Level}\ L\ \text{to}\ (L+1)</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>

